  "flow_summary": "The system successfully completed the intake and managed the patient's imprecision well by re-prompting for specific answers when the patient was vague. However, the system failed to follow the requirement to ask each PHQ-9 and GAD-7 item exactly once, as it repeatedly prompted for the response options when the patient expressed difficulty, rather than simply clarifying the question or accepting the input.",
